# Practical 3 — Cheat Sheet 🪑

Aim: To create a 3D chair model in Blender, import it into Godot 4 using glTF (`.glb`), and implement automatic chair rotation using a GDScript attached to the chair.

This cheat sheet follows your Practical 3 PDF, including the Blender dimensions, Godot scene setup, camera settings, and scripts.&#x20;

